WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.550
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.820 --> 01:38.990
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.330 --> 01:41.740
[Episode 25]

4
01:52.210 --> 01:52.920
Get out.

5
02:05.060 --> 02:06.990
Are you going to ignore me forever?

6
02:12.500 --> 02:13.550
The father and son

7
02:13.750 --> 02:15.860
sold defective guns to the Yu Army,

8
02:16.740 --> 02:18.540
causing soldiers to die in vain.

9
02:18.970 --> 02:19.870
Shooting them

10
02:19.870 --> 02:21.270
is letting them off easy.

11
02:24.840 --> 02:26.140
I don't want to judge

12
02:26.160 --> 02:26.770
whether your decision

13
02:26.770 --> 02:27.810
is right or wrong.

14
02:29.079 --> 02:30.480
As for military affairs,

15
02:30.970 --> 02:32.970
I am even less qualified to comment.

16
02:33.180 --> 02:34.360
But I know

17
02:36.020 --> 02:37.840
this is not the life I want.

18
02:41.520 --> 02:42.750
Military affairs

19
02:43.590 --> 02:45.120
have nothing to do with you.

20
02:46.250 --> 02:47.130
As for military affairs,

21
02:47.130 --> 02:48.590
I know nothing about them.

22
02:50.020 --> 02:51.860
But I know very well

23
02:52.579 --> 02:53.280
that I

24
02:54.300 --> 02:55.340
want to live

25
02:56.020 --> 02:58.090
a peaceful life.

26
03:03.650 --> 03:04.780
What does that mean?

27
03:09.130 --> 03:10.460
I mean,

28
03:13.250 --> 03:14.910
I have the right to choose

29
03:14.910 --> 03:16.690
the life I want.

30
03:31.520 --> 03:32.520
You want to leave?

31
03:33.750 --> 03:35.280
I have the freedom to leave.

32
03:42.020 --> 03:43.350
As long as I don't agree,

33
03:45.090 --> 03:45.930
you can't take a single step

34
03:45.930 --> 03:47.060
away from me.

35
03:51.690 --> 03:52.860
Are you going to keep me

36
03:52.860 --> 03:54.920
locked up here for the rest of my life?

37
03:55.900 --> 03:57.360
There's no reason I can't.

38
04:05.500 --> 04:06.360
From today on,

39
04:06.960 --> 04:07.590
the Fifth Young Madam

40
04:07.590 --> 04:09.390
is not allowed to leave Fengtai.

41
04:10.560 --> 04:11.470
Yu Changxuan,

42
04:11.870 --> 04:13.400
you have no right to do this.

43
04:15.650 --> 04:16.720
Of course I do.

44
04:30.220 --> 04:38.340
[Tai'an Inn]

45
04:40.390 --> 04:42.050
I'm looking for Tong Chunhai.

46
04:42.420 --> 04:43.280
Please come in.

47
04:48.370 --> 04:49.830
Miss Lan Qing, I knew you

48
04:49.890 --> 04:51.630
would definitely need my help.

49
04:59.510 --> 05:00.160
These are all

50
05:00.160 --> 05:01.540
your treasures.

51
05:02.500 --> 05:04.100
Since we are confidants,

52
05:04.860 --> 05:05.750
how could I

53
05:05.750 --> 05:07.040
take what you love?

54
05:34.450 --> 05:35.510
All top quality.

55
05:44.600 --> 05:45.270
How much?

56
05:46.370 --> 05:47.270
Free of charge.

57
05:52.220 --> 05:53.690
For such a huge favor,

58
05:55.120 --> 05:56.920
what exactly do you want me to do?

59
06:01.300 --> 06:03.000
I want Ye Pingjun.

60
07:52.659 --> 07:54.920
You have quite the backbone, my darling.

61
07:55.070 --> 07:57.330
Running away from home on a stormy night,

62
07:57.620 --> 07:59.350
without taking a single thing.

63
08:00.710 --> 08:01.810
Everything here

64
08:01.830 --> 08:03.180
belongs to you.

65
08:03.830 --> 08:05.230
I have no right to take it.

66
08:07.610 --> 08:09.470
It seems you've made up your mind.

67
08:13.980 --> 08:15.280
I have, after all, taken care of you

68
08:15.280 --> 08:16.410
for quite some time.

69
08:18.310 --> 08:19.930
Who was it that said

70
08:20.270 --> 08:22.530
we could let our feelings grow over time?

71
08:23.810 --> 08:25.670
Now that you're back on your feet,

72
08:27.180 --> 08:28.310
you're leaving me?

73
08:30.310 --> 08:31.480
You know very well that the two of us

74
08:31.480 --> 08:32.270
are completely incompatible.

75
08:32.270 --> 08:33.730
Why do you have to force it?

76
08:41.320 --> 08:41.909
Fine.

77
08:44.270 --> 08:45.670
If you insist on leaving,

78
08:46.630 --> 08:47.500
no problem.

79
08:49.390 --> 08:50.860
Y-You... let go of me.

80
08:56.100 --> 08:56.900
You're crazy.

81
08:57.010 --> 08:58.080
Where are you going?

82
08:58.080 --> 08:59.680
For the sake of our marriage,

83
09:00.030 --> 09:01.030
let me see you off.

84
09:01.770 --> 09:02.740
I don't need you to see me off.

85
09:02.740 --> 09:04.000
Here's your ring back.

86
09:04.440 --> 09:05.220
Let go.

87
09:07.200 --> 09:08.100
Let go.

88
09:10.630 --> 09:12.020
From today on,

89
09:12.770 --> 09:14.340
I am your husband.

90
09:15.790 --> 09:17.200
And you are my wife.

91
09:55.910 --> 09:56.670
Besides being by my side,

92
09:56.670 --> 09:57.870
where else can you go?

93
10:35.010 --> 10:37.030
Yu Changxuan, let go!

94
10:37.390 --> 10:38.390
Yu Changxuan.

95
10:38.720 --> 10:40.060
Let go.

96
10:40.220 --> 10:41.310
Yu Changxuan.

97
10:41.340 --> 10:42.470
Let me go.

98
10:45.380 --> 10:46.450
Let me go.

99
10:46.980 --> 10:47.940
Let go.

100
11:35.620 --> 11:38.350
Will you change by yourself, or should I help you?

101
11:41.820 --> 11:42.580
Get out.

102
12:33.130 --> 12:33.770
I know.

103
12:35.750 --> 12:37.170
I terrified you today.

104
12:39.410 --> 12:40.250
I'm sorry.

105
12:43.820 --> 12:44.820
But, Pingjun,

106
12:46.200 --> 12:47.950
a person in my position

107
12:48.910 --> 12:50.070
has no choice

108
12:51.620 --> 12:52.870
in many things.

109
12:54.170 --> 12:56.030
Surrounded by wolves and tigers,

110
12:57.080 --> 12:58.880
facing open and hidden attacks.

111
12:59.620 --> 13:00.640
This path

112
13:02.010 --> 13:04.170
is paved with blood.

113
13:10.250 --> 13:12.120
Cai Fuhu and his son

114
13:13.010 --> 13:15.410
colluded with the enemy for personal gain,

115
13:15.960 --> 13:17.080
killing so many

116
13:17.080 --> 13:19.210
soldiers fighting on the front lines.

117
13:21.510 --> 13:23.310
If I don't punish them severely,

118
13:24.770 --> 13:26.430
how can I convince the public?

119
13:28.270 --> 13:30.600
How can I ever make it up to those soldiers?

120
13:36.360 --> 13:37.970
I never wanted you to see

121
13:37.990 --> 13:38.770
that filth

122
13:39.010 --> 13:40.080
and cruelty.

123
13:42.960 --> 13:44.030
What I want to do

124
13:46.320 --> 13:47.780
is keep you safe behind me,

125
13:49.580 --> 13:51.510
away from all the bloodshed

126
13:51.510 --> 13:52.580
and cruelty.

127
13:55.320 --> 13:56.350
But today,

128
13:56.370 --> 13:57.320
you still saw it.

129
14:02.390 --> 14:03.370
I'm very sorry.

130
14:53.830 --> 14:56.870
[Xiangxi Hotel]

131
14:56.870 --> 14:57.530
Changxuan.

132
14:57.790 --> 14:59.340
We've carved out a new area

133
14:59.360 --> 15:01.120
in Changping Mountain

134
15:01.220 --> 15:02.870
and established an aircraft manufacturing department there.

135
15:02.870 --> 15:04.510
The factory, hangar, and warehouse

136
15:04.510 --> 15:06.010
have also been expanded successively.

137
15:06.010 --> 15:06.770
In terms of personnel,

138
15:06.770 --> 15:08.010
we have selected from the Shipbuilding Bureau

139
15:08.010 --> 15:09.200
40 highly skilled

140
15:09.200 --> 15:10.820
mechanics,

141
15:10.820 --> 15:12.880
fitters, painters, and carpenters,

142
15:12.980 --> 15:13.740
planning to train them as the first batch

143
15:13.740 --> 15:16.940
of technical workers for the Manufacturing Department.

144
15:18.510 --> 15:19.410
The first time I had the idea

145
15:19.410 --> 15:21.910
of setting up an Aircraft Manufacturing Department

146
15:21.910 --> 15:23.080
was when I visited Japan

147
15:23.080 --> 15:25.170
and saw their army and navy military exercises.

148
15:25.170 --> 15:27.830
The Japanese authorities were extremely showy

149
15:28.100 --> 15:29.330
and contemptuous.

150
15:29.720 --> 15:30.620
I realized that

151
15:31.550 --> 15:32.610
only with aircraft

152
15:33.670 --> 15:35.200
can the army have strength.

153
15:35.670 --> 15:37.930
We all understand your ambition, Mr. Yu.

154
15:38.150 --> 15:39.700
European countries have imposed

155
15:39.700 --> 15:40.770
a technological blockade on us.

156
15:40.770 --> 15:42.510
This time, Cheng Jun's intercepted aircraft

157
15:42.510 --> 15:43.710
and flight personnel

158
15:43.910 --> 15:45.370
can be put to good use.

159
15:46.980 --> 15:47.870
One day,

160
15:48.820 --> 15:49.930
we Chinese will build

161
15:49.930 --> 15:51.340
our own patrol aircraft,

162
15:51.510 --> 15:54.040
reconnaissance aircraft, and fighter jets,

163
15:55.220 --> 15:57.630
and form our own aviation fleet.

164
16:02.700 --> 16:04.300
This color really suits you.

165
16:04.320 --> 16:05.720
I think it looks good too.

166
16:11.460 --> 16:12.250
Pingjun.

167
16:13.500 --> 16:15.900
The tailoring and embroidery of this dress

168
16:16.120 --> 16:17.620
really suit your temperament.

169
16:17.620 --> 16:19.080
It's uniquely beautiful.

170
16:20.170 --> 16:21.080
Lan Qing,

171
16:21.480 --> 16:23.140
you really went out of your way

172
16:23.200 --> 16:24.820
to prepare these for me.

173
16:26.340 --> 16:27.480
I promised Changxuan

174
16:27.480 --> 16:28.940
to take good care of you.

175
16:30.690 --> 16:35.150
[Nishang Garments]

176
16:35.150 --> 16:36.270
It's getting late.

177
16:36.410 --> 16:37.750
I'll take you back first.

178
16:37.750 --> 16:39.750
Otherwise, Changxuan will blame me

179
16:39.860 --> 16:40.990
if he can't find you.

180
16:42.900 --> 16:49.620
[Nishang Garments]

181
16:50.910 --> 16:52.220
Sir, to Fengtai.

182
16:52.220 --> 16:52.960
Alright.

183
17:19.349 --> 17:20.010
Sir,

184
17:20.160 --> 17:22.160
this isn't the way to Fengtai, is it?

185
17:25.980 --> 17:27.109
Who exactly are you?

186
17:28.220 --> 17:29.080
Somebody help!

187
17:29.220 --> 17:30.310
Help!

188
17:51.880 --> 17:52.760
Young Madam Yu.

189
17:53.160 --> 17:54.380
My surname is Tong.

190
17:54.900 --> 17:56.240
I'm Tong Chunhai.

191
17:57.850 --> 17:59.420
Why did you tie me up here?

192
18:03.420 --> 18:05.570
Fifth Young Master Yu holds great power

193
18:05.570 --> 18:07.170
and is incredibly arrogant.

194
18:07.660 --> 18:09.080
I was just curious

195
18:09.530 --> 18:10.570
about what kind of woman

196
18:10.570 --> 18:12.310
he would fall for.

197
18:13.070 --> 18:14.380
So even before we met,

198
18:14.480 --> 18:15.330
I had already become

199
18:15.330 --> 18:17.330
an admirer of yours, Young Madam Yu.

200
18:17.750 --> 18:20.010
I just wanted to see your beautiful face.

201
18:21.270 --> 18:22.840
You tied me up here

202
18:23.180 --> 18:24.780
to use me against Changxuan.

203
18:26.510 --> 18:27.980
You're quite smart.

204
18:28.530 --> 18:29.590
You guessed right,

205
18:30.070 --> 18:31.420
but it's too late.

206
18:33.000 --> 18:34.000
See that?

207
18:35.440 --> 18:36.840
Our Fifth Young Master Yu

208
18:37.460 --> 18:39.060
doesn't have much time left.

209
18:40.500 --> 18:41.240
Changxuan!

210
18:43.180 --> 18:44.070
What happened?

211
18:44.180 --> 18:45.810
Pingjun and I finished picking out cheongsams

212
18:45.810 --> 18:47.550
and hired 2 rickshaws to take us back to Fengtai.

213
18:47.550 --> 18:48.650
Who knew her rickshaw

214
18:48.650 --> 18:49.960
would vanish into thin air halfway there?

215
18:49.960 --> 18:51.810
I don't know where she went either.

216
18:51.810 --> 18:52.740
What did you say?

217
18:53.530 --> 18:54.190
Changxuan,

218
18:54.220 --> 18:55.140
I'll send someone to look for her.

219
18:55.140 --> 18:55.590
Mr. Yu.

220
18:56.640 --> 18:57.310
Mr. Yu.

221
18:58.350 --> 18:58.980
Mr. Yu.

222
18:59.220 --> 19:00.550
Someone just delivered a letter to the main gate,

223
19:00.550 --> 19:01.940
saying it should be given directly to you.

224
19:01.940 --> 19:02.800
Where are they?

225
19:02.810 --> 19:04.610
He left right after saying that.

226
19:06.920 --> 19:09.380
[Get to Warehouse No. 15 in Nanyuan within 2 hours]

227
19:12.050 --> 19:12.770
Who is this?

228
19:12.770 --> 19:14.260
They are too bold.

229
19:14.680 --> 19:16.210
To collect Pingjun's body?

230
19:16.270 --> 19:17.870
This is clearly aimed at you.

231
19:21.770 --> 19:22.310
Changxuan.

232
19:22.310 --> 19:23.770
Mr. Yu, where are you going?

233
19:23.770 --> 19:24.700
Don't follow me.

234
19:26.480 --> 19:27.290
I'll go alone.

235
19:31.310 --> 19:32.160
What should we do?

236
19:32.160 --> 19:35.020
Get some men from the military headquarters first.

237
19:45.810 --> 19:47.010
Tong Chunhai.

238
19:48.770 --> 19:51.430
So Ye Pingjun wasn't the one he wanted after all.

239
20:05.720 --> 20:07.110
I told you already.

240
20:07.810 --> 20:09.810
Yu Changxuan doesn't care about me.

241
20:09.980 --> 20:11.510
He won't take this risk.

242
20:14.850 --> 20:15.910
If he doesn't come,

243
20:18.290 --> 20:20.020
such a beautiful little flower

244
20:21.220 --> 20:22.670
will wither.

245
20:57.010 --> 20:58.470
Mrs. Yu, it seems you've underestimated

246
20:58.470 --> 20:59.480
your place in Mr. Yu's

247
20:59.480 --> 21:00.550
heart.

248
21:05.480 --> 21:06.420
Are you hurt?

249
21:06.980 --> 21:07.900
Why did you come?

250
21:07.900 --> 21:08.750
Don't move.

251
21:10.770 --> 21:11.880
As you said,

252
21:12.920 --> 21:13.900
I came alone.

253
21:15.350 --> 21:17.360
Mr. Yu, you really keep your word.

254
21:17.810 --> 21:18.940
But for the safety

255
21:18.970 --> 21:19.980
of your wife,

256
21:20.190 --> 21:21.920
you can't keep your gun either.

257
21:40.310 --> 21:41.530
Kick it further away.

258
21:49.960 --> 21:50.750
Who are you?

259
21:51.480 --> 21:52.770
What is your purpose?

260
21:56.480 --> 21:57.480
You don't know me?

261
21:58.980 --> 22:00.510
You actually don't know me?

262
22:09.180 --> 22:10.750
He doesn't know me!

263
22:13.180 --> 22:14.980
At the auction in Xiangxi Hotel,

264
22:15.310 --> 22:16.220
your men pointed a gun

265
22:16.220 --> 22:17.320
at my head

266
22:18.160 --> 22:20.020
and treated me as an auction item.

267
22:21.750 --> 22:23.200
What exactly do you want?

268
22:27.810 --> 22:28.810
Tong Chunhai?

269
22:30.780 --> 22:33.110
Mr. Yu, you finally remembered.

270
22:33.810 --> 22:35.010
Took you long enough.

271
22:35.420 --> 22:36.820
What exactly do you want?

272
22:37.160 --> 22:38.890
You were so arrogant back then.

273
22:39.250 --> 22:40.890
After the auction that day,

274
22:40.910 --> 22:41.880
your soldiers

275
22:41.880 --> 22:43.180
kicked and punched me,

276
22:43.400 --> 22:44.640
literally ruining

277
22:44.670 --> 22:45.670
one of my kidneys.

278
22:46.050 --> 22:47.400
I had surgery,

279
22:47.680 --> 22:48.750
and barely managed to save

280
22:48.750 --> 22:49.400
my life.

281
22:51.000 --> 22:52.130
And now you actually

282
22:52.270 --> 22:53.930
forgot all about me.

283
22:55.570 --> 22:57.770
The one you want to take revenge on is me.

284
22:58.610 --> 22:59.610
Let my wife go.

285
23:00.900 --> 23:01.750
Mr. Yu,

286
23:02.770 --> 23:04.150
now is not the time

287
23:04.180 --> 23:05.980
for you to give orders.

288
23:09.660 --> 23:11.380
If you want me to let her go,

289
23:12.810 --> 23:14.720
show me the attitude of begging.

290
23:15.310 --> 23:16.640
What do you want me to do?

291
23:24.420 --> 23:25.920
Kneel down.

292
23:28.610 --> 23:29.920
Changxuan, no!

293
23:30.240 --> 23:32.960
Don't move. Bullets have no eyes.

294
24:12.920 --> 24:14.570
The dignified Mr. Yu

295
24:14.670 --> 24:16.800
is actually kneeling for a woman.

296
24:19.030 --> 24:20.690
You truly deserve to be called

297
24:20.720 --> 24:22.850
a famous hero in Nanhuai.

298
24:22.960 --> 24:23.620
Bullying a weak

299
24:23.620 --> 24:25.840
and defenseless woman.

300
24:25.960 --> 24:26.960
What's the point?

301
24:28.510 --> 24:30.240
Come at me if you have a problem.

302
24:35.480 --> 24:37.610
You just had to be the hero, didn't you?

303
24:38.010 --> 24:38.480
Fine.

304
24:39.420 --> 24:40.620
I'll grant your wish.

305
24:41.720 --> 24:43.120
What are you waiting for?

306
24:45.600 --> 24:46.570
Yu Changxuan!

307
24:48.570 --> 24:50.240
Stop beating him!

308
24:50.940 --> 24:51.480
Beat him!

309
24:53.140 --> 24:54.110
Yu Changxuan!

310
24:54.140 --> 24:55.810
Fight back!

311
24:57.530 --> 24:59.290
Fight back!

312
25:02.050 --> 25:03.820
Stop beating him!

313
25:05.730 --> 25:09.100
I beg you, stop beating him!

314
25:10.180 --> 25:12.240
I beg you!

315
25:20.270 --> 25:21.790
Yu Changxuan.

316
25:23.040 --> 25:25.470
You are a fool.

317
25:28.160 --> 25:30.480
I don't remember anything.

318
25:30.900 --> 25:33.390
I'm not worth it.

319
25:41.220 --> 25:42.250
Don't cry.

320
25:46.790 --> 25:48.590
You look so ugly

321
25:52.500 --> 25:53.680
when you cry.

322
25:55.740 --> 25:56.670
Don't be afraid.

323
26:03.380 --> 26:04.220
The doctor said

324
26:04.220 --> 26:05.810
you might never wake up.

325
26:06.510 --> 26:08.480
But Fifth Young Master insisted on marrying you.

326
26:08.480 --> 26:09.810
He even told the Master

327
26:09.810 --> 26:11.620
that even if you never woke up,

328
26:11.720 --> 26:14.380
he would take care of you for the rest of his life.

329
26:19.160 --> 26:19.980
Relax.

330
26:25.880 --> 26:26.680
Yu Changxuan.

331
26:26.750 --> 26:28.660
I can walk. I did it.

332
26:29.010 --> 26:30.070
Congratulations.

333
26:44.870 --> 26:48.610
Now you can let her go.

334
26:49.920 --> 26:52.120
What a devoted lover.

335
26:52.920 --> 26:53.750
No wonder.

336
26:54.250 --> 26:55.200
If I had

337
26:55.220 --> 26:55.850
such a beautiful wife

338
26:55.850 --> 26:57.740
at home,

339
26:58.400 --> 26:59.070
I would also be willing

340
26:59.070 --> 27:00.790
to go through fire and water.

341
27:04.460 --> 27:05.320
How about this?

342
27:06.070 --> 27:06.640
I'm not someone

343
27:06.640 --> 27:08.640
who doesn't know how to treat a lady.

344
27:10.850 --> 27:11.660
Young Madam.

345
27:13.290 --> 27:14.890
Why don't I give you a chance?

346
27:25.290 --> 27:26.440
Pick up the knife.

347
27:44.460 --> 27:45.250
Very good.

348
27:46.750 --> 27:47.810
Now go over there

349
27:48.550 --> 27:49.520
and kill him.

350
27:49.920 --> 27:51.680
Tong Chunhai, you're crazy.

351
27:51.700 --> 27:53.390
Only one of you

352
27:53.410 --> 27:54.870
can walk out of here alive.

353
27:55.750 --> 27:56.550
Kill him.

354
27:57.120 --> 27:58.720
Then you can leave.

355
28:01.960 --> 28:03.040
Pingjun.

356
28:04.610 --> 28:05.460
Listen to him.

357
28:05.960 --> 28:07.090
That's impossible.

358
28:07.240 --> 28:08.050
Then both of you

359
28:08.050 --> 28:09.160
will die here together.

360
28:09.160 --> 28:10.270
Don't touch her!

361
28:16.640 --> 28:18.320
Pingjun, come here.

362
28:19.350 --> 28:20.160
Be good.

363
28:23.590 --> 28:25.520
Ye Pingjun, I told you to come here!

364
28:25.700 --> 28:26.610
Did you hear me?

365
29:04.660 --> 29:05.590
Don't be afraid.

366
29:07.240 --> 29:08.080
Come here.

367
29:19.270 --> 29:20.920
Incredible.

368
29:21.420 --> 29:23.290
Mr. Yu actually risked his life

369
29:23.310 --> 29:25.000
for his wife.

370
29:33.240 --> 29:33.880
Come here.

371
29:44.220 --> 29:44.880
Come here.

372
29:49.700 --> 29:50.500
Pingjun!

373
29:52.010 --> 29:53.070
What are you doing?

374
29:53.200 --> 29:54.260
Let him go.

375
29:55.450 --> 29:56.810
I'll give you my life.

376
29:57.510 --> 29:58.310
Pingjun.

377
29:59.830 --> 30:00.880
Pingjun.

378
30:01.790 --> 30:02.850
Put the knife down.

379
30:08.280 --> 30:09.190
Changxuan.

380
30:12.850 --> 30:14.460
You saved my life.

381
30:19.010 --> 30:20.930
You gave me everything.

382
30:23.810 --> 30:24.550
But I have nothing

383
30:24.550 --> 30:26.020
to give you.

384
30:35.490 --> 30:36.220
Hurry up.

385
30:48.590 --> 30:49.510
Ye Pingjun.

386
30:50.720 --> 30:53.030
Are you really willing to die for him?

387
30:53.810 --> 30:54.700
I am.

388
30:56.000 --> 30:56.790
Come on.

389
30:57.640 --> 30:58.840
Shoot!

390
31:00.920 --> 31:01.720
Okay.

391
31:03.140 --> 31:04.640
Then I'll grant your wish.

392
31:06.870 --> 31:08.130
Pingjun!

393
31:12.330 --> 31:13.480
Yu Changxuan.

394
31:17.850 --> 31:18.790
Don't move.

395
31:24.110 --> 31:24.920
Changxuan.

396
31:25.660 --> 31:26.460
Changxuan.

397
31:30.530 --> 31:31.440
Are you okay?

398
31:35.810 --> 31:37.480
Are you okay?

399
31:43.270 --> 31:44.070
Changxuan.

400
31:44.750 --> 31:45.550
Changxuan!

401
31:47.070 --> 31:48.290
-Mr. Yu. -Changxuan.

402
31:48.310 --> 31:48.870
Mr. Yu.

403
31:48.960 --> 31:49.620
Changxuan.

404
31:49.690 --> 31:50.290
Mr. Yu.

405
31:51.070 --> 31:52.010
Changxuan.

406
32:48.160 --> 32:48.750
Doctor.

407
32:48.980 --> 32:49.680
Mrs. Yu.

408
32:53.380 --> 32:54.160
Mr. Yu's wounds

409
32:54.160 --> 32:55.420
have all been treated.

410
32:55.500 --> 32:57.420
He still needs to stay in the hospital for observation for a few days

411
32:57.420 --> 32:58.660
to avoid inflammation.

412
32:58.660 --> 32:59.720
Thank you, Doctor.

413
33:00.550 --> 33:01.480
You're welcome.

414
33:01.570 --> 33:02.100
Let's go.

415
33:10.310 --> 33:11.070
Let me do it.

416
33:51.720 --> 33:52.810
Look at my memory.

417
33:52.850 --> 33:54.780
I suddenly remembered something.

418
33:55.090 --> 33:56.140
Gu is

419
33:56.200 --> 33:57.100
rushing to interrogate

420
33:57.100 --> 33:57.940
Tong Chunhai.

421
33:58.090 --> 33:58.920
We must make this guy

422
33:58.920 --> 33:59.720
spit out the whole story

423
33:59.720 --> 34:01.070
in detail.

424
34:01.310 --> 34:03.110
And over at Changping Mountain,

425
34:03.570 --> 34:04.980
Wu Zuoxiao has a lot to do.

426
34:04.980 --> 34:06.510
I have to go over and lend a hand.

427
34:06.510 --> 34:07.660
The few of us

428
34:07.700 --> 34:08.900
will definitely be

429
34:08.900 --> 34:10.300
tied up during this time.

430
34:12.920 --> 34:14.000
So,

431
34:14.090 --> 34:15.730
the hard work of taking care of my brother

432
34:15.730 --> 34:17.730
will have to be left to you, Pingjun.

433
34:23.690 --> 34:24.800
You guys go ahead.

434
34:25.190 --> 34:26.480
Just leave this to me.

435
34:27.320 --> 34:27.880
Alright.

436
34:28.940 --> 34:29.630
Then you...

437
34:33.090 --> 34:34.219
I'll head out first.

438
34:34.980 --> 34:35.710
Please stay.

439
34:35.880 --> 34:36.810
Don't see me out.

440
34:37.630 --> 34:38.300
Go ahead.

441
34:41.900 --> 34:42.690
Continue.

442
34:54.090 --> 34:55.050
These days,

443
34:55.130 --> 34:57.070
it's inconvenient for you to do anything.

444
34:57.070 --> 34:58.880
If you want to eat or drink anything,

445
34:58.880 --> 35:00.000
just tell me.

446
35:00.170 --> 35:01.330
I'll help you.

447
35:04.380 --> 35:05.840
I'm actually a bit hungry.

448
35:23.800 --> 35:24.930
Sitting so far away,

449
35:25.110 --> 35:26.170
how can you feed me?

450
35:43.530 --> 35:44.300
Here.

451
36:09.190 --> 36:09.800
If you keep doing this,

452
36:09.800 --> 36:11.340
you might tear your wound.

453
36:11.800 --> 36:13.190
If you don't move around,

454
36:13.190 --> 36:14.500
I won't pull the wound.

455
36:16.400 --> 36:17.620
Sit still and eat.

456
36:22.280 --> 36:23.170
Is the wound okay?

457
36:23.170 --> 36:23.980
Does it hurt?

458
36:24.880 --> 36:26.230
The wound is fine.

459
36:27.010 --> 36:27.920
My heart hurts.

460
36:42.500 --> 36:43.380
Yu Changxuan.

461
36:45.170 --> 36:46.130
For today,

462
36:47.590 --> 36:48.360
thank you.

463
36:57.550 --> 36:58.360
Promise me,

464
36:59.820 --> 37:01.880
no matter what happens in the future,

465
37:02.900 --> 37:04.360
don't sacrifice yourself

466
37:04.940 --> 37:06.230
for me.

467
37:08.730 --> 37:10.670
The most important thing to me

468
37:12.670 --> 37:13.630
is that you

469
37:14.710 --> 37:16.070
stay alive and healthy.

470
37:23.940 --> 37:25.800
Actually, there is a question

471
37:27.610 --> 37:29.460
I've never asked you.

472
37:30.570 --> 37:31.510
Tell me.

473
37:32.690 --> 37:34.690
We used to love each other very much,

474
37:35.300 --> 37:36.090
right?

475
38:00.260 --> 38:01.580
You lie down first.

476
38:02.210 --> 38:04.210
I'll clean up the things over there.

477
38:04.500 --> 38:04.960
Come on.

478
38:08.460 --> 38:09.030
Careful.

479
38:10.920 --> 38:11.430
Come on.

480
38:24.980 --> 38:25.630
Careful.

481
38:31.210 --> 38:31.940
Careful.

482
38:44.690 --> 38:45.730
Don't go.

483
38:51.510 --> 38:52.930
I won't go.

484
38:53.940 --> 38:55.480
I'll stay outside with you.

485
38:56.360 --> 38:57.560
If you need anything,

486
38:58.260 --> 38:59.550
just call me.

487
39:04.360 --> 39:05.220
Get some sleep.

488
39:29.960 --> 39:31.900
Actually, there is a question

489
39:33.570 --> 39:35.440
I've never asked you.

490
39:36.210 --> 39:38.210
We used to love each other very much,

491
39:38.900 --> 39:39.590
right?

492
39:52.880 --> 39:54.730
You guys are too bold.

493
39:54.940 --> 39:57.130
Such a big matter as Changxuan's injury,

494
39:57.130 --> 39:58.590
how dare you hide it from me?

495
39:58.590 --> 39:59.810
Is it because I'm usually

496
39:59.810 --> 40:01.010
too lenient with you?

497
40:01.400 --> 40:03.670
You've forgotten the most basic rules.

498
40:03.800 --> 40:04.780
It was my negligence.

499
40:04.780 --> 40:05.800
Where is he?

500
40:05.860 --> 40:06.820
In this ward.

501
40:07.790 --> 40:08.850
[Ward 2]

502
40:11.880 --> 40:12.670
Pingjun?

503
40:16.380 --> 40:17.170
Young Madam,

504
40:17.190 --> 40:19.250
this is Fifth Young Master's mother.

505
40:20.980 --> 40:21.880
Hello, Auntie.

506
40:22.570 --> 40:24.800
They told me you woke up,

507
40:24.800 --> 40:26.640
and I couldn't believe it.

508
40:33.940 --> 40:35.370
Do you really

509
40:35.390 --> 40:36.720
not remember anything?

510
40:38.400 --> 40:39.190
Yes.

511
40:40.170 --> 40:41.530
As for the past,

512
40:42.000 --> 40:44.210
I really don't remember anything.

513
40:45.800 --> 40:46.910
It's okay.

514
40:47.190 --> 40:48.990
It's okay if you don't remember.

515
40:49.230 --> 40:51.890
We will make sure you get the care you need,

516
40:52.000 --> 40:53.030
and maybe you will

517
40:53.030 --> 40:54.710
remember in time.

518
41:00.400 --> 41:02.320
Changxuan just fell asleep.

519
41:02.760 --> 41:03.780
Don't worry.

520
41:19.130 --> 41:20.480
Do you know

521
41:21.690 --> 41:22.720
what he's been through

522
41:22.720 --> 41:24.300
these past two years?

523
41:28.090 --> 41:29.550
When you had the accident,

524
41:30.240 --> 41:33.020
it almost cost him half his life.

525
41:36.090 --> 41:38.490
The doctor said the chances of you waking up

526
41:38.530 --> 41:39.780
were almost zero.

527
41:40.690 --> 41:42.030
But he just insisted

528
41:42.030 --> 41:43.630
on staying by your side

529
41:44.110 --> 41:45.550
and guarding you.

530
41:47.730 --> 41:50.030
All his stubbornness

531
41:51.380 --> 41:53.440
turned into patience

532
41:53.440 --> 41:54.840
to take care of you.

533
41:56.530 --> 41:58.110
I know in my heart

534
41:59.530 --> 42:00.960
that Changxuan is

535
42:02.420 --> 42:03.650
really good to me.

536
42:04.250 --> 42:06.840
It's great that you're awake now.

537
42:07.440 --> 42:08.620
His sincerity

538
42:08.650 --> 42:10.400
moved the heavens.

539
42:14.820 --> 42:15.820
My child,

540
42:17.090 --> 42:19.150
you've made it through this.

541
42:19.900 --> 42:22.560
Whatever obstacles come your way in the future,

542
42:22.670 --> 42:24.280
you can overcome them.

543
42:28.880 --> 42:29.670
Auntie,

544
42:30.570 --> 42:31.510
thank you.

545
42:34.300 --> 42:35.800
Still calling me Auntie?

546
42:41.190 --> 42:42.090
It's okay.

547
42:42.800 --> 42:45.500
It's fine if you're not used to it yet.

548
42:45.500 --> 42:47.800
But you have to promise me one thing.

549
42:49.050 --> 42:49.840
Tell me.

550
42:51.070 --> 42:52.630
When he recovers,

551
42:52.900 --> 42:54.030
you two must

552
42:54.030 --> 42:56.090
move back to the residence together.

553
42:57.130 --> 42:58.690
You are now the young madam

554
42:58.690 --> 43:00.350
of Yu's Residence.

555
43:00.590 --> 43:02.400
What's with you

556
43:02.550 --> 43:03.150
staying...

557
43:03.150 --> 43:06.000
staying in Fengtai all the time?

558
43:25.880 --> 43:26.780
Was my mom here?

559
43:29.400 --> 43:30.620
While you were asleep,

560
43:30.620 --> 43:32.120
Auntie came to see you.

561
43:32.280 --> 43:33.590
These dishes are still hot.

562
43:33.590 --> 43:35.120
Eat them while they're hot.

563
43:48.590 --> 43:49.940
This dish is so salty.

564
43:51.500 --> 43:54.030
It's like she dumped the whole salt shaker in.

565
44:01.300 --> 44:02.300
This steamed egg is

566
44:02.300 --> 44:03.360
harder than a rock.

567
44:05.050 --> 44:06.160
How did my mom's cooking

568
44:06.160 --> 44:07.070
get so bad?

569
44:10.460 --> 44:11.170
Mr. Yu,

570
44:11.380 --> 44:13.030
you're finally eating.

571
44:13.800 --> 44:15.460
Mrs. Yu spent over 4 hours

572
44:15.570 --> 44:16.210
preparing your meal

573
44:16.210 --> 44:17.940
in the kitchen this afternoon.

574
44:18.340 --> 44:19.200
The doctor said

575
44:19.260 --> 44:20.480
you need to watch your diet.

576
44:20.480 --> 44:21.730
When Mrs. Yu was cooking,

577
44:21.730 --> 44:23.190
she had to make it light but flavorful.

578
44:23.190 --> 44:23.940
That sea bass

579
44:23.940 --> 44:25.670
took her a long time to prepare.

580
44:26.530 --> 44:27.280
You eat first.

581
44:27.280 --> 44:27.990
I'll come back later

582
44:27.990 --> 44:29.390
to give you an injection.

583
44:42.400 --> 44:43.560
Did you make

584
44:45.880 --> 44:47.070
all these dishes?

585
44:51.400 --> 44:53.610
Don't eat if it doesn't taste good.

586
44:53.730 --> 44:55.260
I'll go buy something else.

587
44:58.380 --> 44:59.070
Stop it.

588
44:59.170 --> 45:00.770
-Your wound... -Don’t move.

589
45:02.790 --> 45:05.050
Just let me hold you like this for a while.

590
45:07.730 --> 45:08.840
Just for a while.

591
45:18.630 --> 45:19.320
Pingjun.

592
45:21.760 --> 45:23.160
I'm very happy right now.

593
45:25.590 --> 45:27.520
Last time you insisted on leaving,

594
45:28.440 --> 45:30.110
I thought I meant

595
45:31.440 --> 45:32.900
nothing to you.

596
45:36.320 --> 45:37.110
Now,

597
45:39.190 --> 45:40.010
does this mean

598
45:40.010 --> 45:41.870
my patience has finally paid off?

599
45:46.260 --> 45:47.170
Yu Changxuan.

600
45:47.880 --> 45:48.610
I know

601
45:50.980 --> 45:51.920
you can't fully accept me

602
45:51.920 --> 45:53.070
just yet.

603
45:55.480 --> 45:56.500
But it's okay.

604
45:58.530 --> 45:59.400
I can wait.

605
46:17.710 --> 46:18.230
Here.

606
46:21.820 --> 46:22.280
Here.

607
46:33.960 --> 46:36.090
I told you I couldn't do it well.

608
46:38.460 --> 46:40.690
I don't know if I'll still get this treatment

609
46:40.690 --> 46:42.390
after I recover.

610
46:43.300 --> 46:45.230
Of course, I'd better make the most

611
46:45.300 --> 46:46.500
of every chance I get.

612
47:33.050 --> 47:33.900
Stop it.

613
47:34.510 --> 47:36.070
I almost hurt you.

614
47:37.190 --> 47:38.050
It's okay.

615
47:38.900 --> 47:40.300
Practice makes perfect.

616
47:41.290 --> 47:42.750
When you get the hang of it,

617
47:43.190 --> 47:44.690
you can shave me every day.

618
47:46.460 --> 47:47.860
Who promised you that?

619
47:49.500 --> 47:51.360
Well, you are my wife.

620
48:13.130 --> 48:14.260
Rest your hand here,

621
48:15.530 --> 48:17.050
and you'll be able to shave me steadily.
